# Local-first development

This repo is the local working copy. GitHub `main` (and Lovable) is the live site.

- Make all changes in this workspace. Preview with `npm run dev` (usually http://localhost:8080).
- Commit locally when asked. Do **not** `git push` unless the user explicitly asks to publish.
- A push to `origin/main` updates the live site. Never force-push, rebase, or rewrite published history.
- Verify UI changes on localhost before considering the work done.
